00:19:34,060 --> 00:19:35,470
I have...

279
00:19:36,190 --> 00:19:37,950
a new project coming up soon!

280
00:19:38,870 --> 00:19:40,880
Please root for me, guys.

281
00:19:40,900 --> 00:19:42,000
I guarantee you,

282
00:19:42,010 --> 00:19:44,280
I won't disappoint.

283
00:19:44,300 --> 00:19:46,870
[I'm waiting by the door.
Come open it, I have a gift for you]

284
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:51,170
[Did you see any of my comments?]

285
00:19:52,010 --> 00:19:52,930
Then, I'll...

286
00:19:52,940 --> 00:19:54,460
end the live right here.

287
00:19:54,470 --> 00:19:56,250
I'll see you again later.

288
00:19:56,260 --> 00:19:57,310
See you next time.

289
00:19:57,820 --> 00:19:59,070
Bye-bye.

290
00:20:14,870 --> 00:20:15,870
Is that you, North?

291
00:20:19,100 --> 00:20:20,870
Hey, come on in!

292
00:20:21,780 --> 00:20:22,590
Hey?

293
00:20:23,970 --> 00:20:24,970
Just come in!

294
00:20:37,480 --> 00:20:38,480
Third, is that you?

295
00:20:44,490 --> 00:20:45,460
Damn it. Who is it?

296
00:21:27,070 --> 00:21:28,140
[I know when you leave your room

297
00:21:28,150 --> 00:21:29,160
and when you come back,

298
00:21:29,170 --> 00:21:30,560
I'm so happy we live in the same condo]

299
00:21:33,670 --> 00:21:34,780
[I did some digging and found out
where you lived, so I moved here long ago,

300
00:21:34,790 --> 00:21:36,120
but you were with that producer earlier,
and I didn't like it at all,

301
00:21:36,130 --> 00:21:37,350
now you're finally all alone
and I like it better this way,

302
00:21:37,360 --> 00:21:38,150
I love ya, XOXOXO]

303
00:21:44,280 --> 00:21:45,480
Whoa, fuck!

304
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:01,480
Hello?

305
00:22:01,670 --> 00:22:02,880
Mama, Mama, Mama.

306
00:22:04,070 --> 00:22:05,580
Mama, just now...

307
00:22:06,060 --> 00:22:07,280
Somebody knocked on my door,

308
00:22:07,300 --> 00:22:09,050
and there was a card left outside,

309
00:22:09,060 --> 00:22:09,760
and like...

310
00:22:09,770 --> 00:22:11,790
It seems like they know
everything about my life,

311
00:22:11,800 --> 00:22:14,570
like, even the fact that
I already broke up with North.

312
00:22:14,580 --> 00:22:16,370
Shit... Hey,

313
00:22:16,390 --> 00:22:17,500
lock the door properly.

314
00:22:17,510 --> 00:22:18,680
Are you still inside?

315
00:22:19,270 --> 00:22:20,270
Hello?

316
00:22:20,300 --> 00:22:21,180
Nine?

317
00:22:21,610 --> 00:22:22,600
What happened, Sunny?

318
00:22:22,620 --> 00:22:23,290
Ugh...

319
00:22:23,910 --> 00:22:24,970
Something happened to Nine.

320
00:22:25,530 --> 00:22:26,480
I'll...

321
00:22:26,500 --> 00:22:27,500
head out.

322
00:22:30,580 --> 00:22:31,290
Right,

323
00:22:31,790 --> 00:22:33,130
what we talked about,

324
00:22:33,150 --> 00:22:34,320
hurry up and take care of it, Third.

325
00:22:34,750 --> 00:22:35,870
It's for your own sake.

326
00:22:36,030 --> 00:22:37,550
Also, lock the door.

327
00:22:37,570 --> 00:22:39,300
Look out for your own safety.

328
00:22:40,110 --> 00:22:42,110
You're not in the same position anymore.

329
00:22:42,120 --> 00:22:43,970
No one can take care of you or protect you.

330
00:22:45,500 --> 00:22:46,270
Alright.

331
00:22:47,300 --> 00:22:48,700
I'm heading out. See you.

332
00:22:48,990 --> 00:22:50,100
Sunny, wait...

333
00:22:51,220 --> 00:22:51,960
Hm?

334
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:01,790
I'm sorry,

335
00:23:02,760 --> 00:23:04,500
and thank you for everything.

336
00:23:31,410 --> 00:23:32,410
I...

337
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:34,320
love you, Third.

338
00:23:35,890 --> 00:23:37,190
Don't think that I don't.

339
00:23:41,300 --> 00:23:42,490
I'm sorry...

340
00:23:43,350 --> 00:23:44,770
I couldn't take good care of you guys.

341
00:23:45,130 --> 00:23:46,390
That's why it ended up like this.

342
00:23:49,790 --> 00:23:52,150
But whatever happens, you...

343
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:53,500
You can always call me.

344
00:23:54,410 --> 00:23:55,890
I'll be on standby.

345
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:00,790
Alright, Mama.

346
00:24:05,290 --> 00:24:06,290
Mm.

347
00:24:07,300 --> 00:24:08,380
I'm leaving now. See you.

348
00:24:21,640 --> 00:24:26,810
[Baan Tiew Shop]

349
00:24:28,400 --> 00:24:29,890
Hello, what's up?

350
00:24:30,190 --> 00:24:31,380
Hello, View.

351
00:24:31,600 --> 00:24:32,950
Where are you? What are you doing?

352
00:24:33,100 --> 00:24:34,790
I'm about to eat.

353
00:24:35,890 --> 00:24:37,080
Eat where?

354
00:24:37,690 --> 00:24:38,690
At our place.

355
00:24:38,900 --> 00:24:40,200
Is Jay there with you?

356
00:24:40,360 --> 00:24:42,280
Stay away from the doors and the windows,

357
00:24:42,480 --> 00:24:44,390
take your food, and eat it in your room.

358
00:24:44,410 --> 00:24:45,860
Ugh, damn you, Wan!

359
00:24:45,870 --> 00:24:47,940
You're acting like someone's gonna
launch a bazooka at me.

360
00:24:48,550 --> 00:24:49,240
And look,

361
00:24:49,590 --> 00:24:51,910
I've been with that guy
from morning till night.

362
00:24:51,920 --> 00:24:53,010
We might as well get together.

363
00:24:54,400 --> 00:24:55,990
Hey, you can't do that!

364
00:24:56,010 --> 00:24:57,260
Well, duh!

365
00:24:57,610 --> 00:24:58,950
Stop being paranoid.

366
00:24:58,970 --> 00:25:00,360
No one's gonna do anything to me.

367
00:25:00,380 --> 00:25:02,290
I can take care of myself, okay?

368
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:04,060
Whoa... Shit, shit.

369
00:25:04,070 --> 00:25:04,550
What now?

370
00:25:04,560 --> 00:25:05,690
I'm hanging up.

371
00:25:08,110 --> 00:25:09,400
Dad, Mom,

372
00:25:09,600 --> 00:25:11,380
don't tell him I'm here.

373
00:25:17,990 --> 00:25:18,900
Hello.

374
00:25:20,850 --> 00:25:21,560
Uh...

375
00:25:21,880 --> 00:25:23,350
I'm here to see Wan.

376
00:25:23,360 --> 00:25:24,990
Is... Is he here?

377
00:25:25,780 --> 00:25:26,600
No.

378
00:25:29,490 --> 00:25:31,190
I haven't been able to get a hold of Wan.

379
00:25:31,430 --> 00:25:33,190
I went to his condo,
and View said he wasn't there.

380
00:25:34,250 --> 00:25:35,920
You guys haven't talked to him at all?

381
00:25:36,640 --> 00:25:37,680
We have not.

382
00:25:42,200 --> 00:25:43,890
Then I'm sorry for bothering you,

383
00:25:47,620 --> 00:25:50,190
but if you get to talk to him,

384
00:25:52,110 --> 00:25:53,490
please tell him

385
00:25:53,890 --> 00:25:55,430
that I miss him.

386
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:06,400
I'm leaving now.

387
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:43,240
Wanna go to a cafe?

388
00:26:43,400 --> 00:26:45,800
I heard they have cute elephants
and a painting activity, too.

389
00:26:45,890 --> 00:26:47,420
Please, please, please,
please, please, please?

390
00:26:48,650 --> 00:26:49,690
If you're with me,

391
00:26:51,120 --> 00:26:52,690
I'll go anywhere.

392
00:29:12,120 --> 00:29:12,740
Mr. Third,

393
00:29:12,760 --> 00:29:13,980
Mr. Nine's going up to your room.

394
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:15,270
I couldn't stop him.

395
00:29:41,650 --> 00:29:42,600
How did you get up here?

396
00:29:43,090 --> 00:29:45,060
Everyone in this country knows
we're an on-screen couple,

397
00:29:45,890 --> 00:29:47,130
so they let me up here.

398
00:29:52,720 --> 00:29:54,530
[Delete from this iPhone]

399
00:30:05,790 --> 00:30:08,290
[Hidden]

400
00:30:13,970 --> 00:30:14,860
[Unhide]

401
00:30:30,230 --> 00:30:31,330
Third.

402
00:30:57,520 --> 00:30:58,910
I'm about to post the video

403
00:30:59,810 --> 00:31:01,500
- where Nine let himself fall...
- Don't do it.

404
00:31:09,610 --> 00:31:10,790
I already gave up.

405
00:31:15,490 --> 00:31:16,900
Don't do anything at all.

406
00:31:18,510 --> 00:31:21,100
Just return to the place you belong.

407
00:31:24,420 --> 00:31:25,300
Wan,

408
00:31:26,320 --> 00:31:27,410
I'm begging you.

409
00:31:32,010 --> 00:31:33,400
I need you.

410
00:31:37,000 --> 00:31:38,600
Please don't ever leave me again.

411
00:31:41,210 --> 00:31:42,090
I'm posting this video

412
00:31:42,100 --> 00:31:43,720
and telling everyone
you're not at fault.

413
00:31:46,910 --> 00:31:48,410
What's the point, Third?

414
00:31:49,720 --> 00:31:51,680
To put Nine on blast
so people can drag him?

415
00:31:52,820 --> 00:31:53,820
Yes.

416
00:31:55,230 --> 00:31:56,680
I don't care about any of them.

417
00:31:59,300 --> 00:32:02,000
But we don't know if he did it, right?

418
00:32:04,590 --> 00:32:06,600
Wasn't this the reason

419
00:32:06,610 --> 00:32:08,120
you didn't leak
the video from the start?

420
00:32:16,090 --> 00:32:18,100
Let's stop it right here.

421
00:32:18,550 --> 00:32:19,540
Everything.

422
00:32:21,520 --> 00:32:23,090
I don't wanna hurt anyone anymore.

423
00:32:23,200 --> 00:32:24,110
I won't stop.

424
00:32:26,310 --> 00:32:28,130
I will find the person who did it.

425
00:32:28,800 --> 00:32:29,900
But right now...

426
00:32:30,890 --> 00:32:33,310
I don't agree with you leaking this video.

427
00:32:35,520 --> 00:32:37,690
Don't drag me into this again.

428
00:32:50,010 --> 00:32:50,790
Let go.

429
00:32:52,410 --> 00:32:53,700
Just move on from me.

430
00:32:54,910 --> 00:32:56,000
Can you move on from me?

431
00:32:58,080 --> 00:32:59,100
I can't.

432
00:33:01,510 --> 00:33:03,200
I swear

433
00:33:05,510 --> 00:33:07,890
I won't ever keep
anything from you again.

434
00:33:09,410 --> 00:33:10,960
No matter what happens,

435
00:33:10,970 --> 00:33:12,300
no matter what comes my way,

436
00:33:13,130 --> 00:33:14,990
I'll ask for your opinion first.

437
00:33:22,610 --> 00:33:24,320
I love you so, so much, Wan.

438
00:33:25,020 --> 00:33:26,290
I really do.

439
00:33:27,810 --> 00:33:30,210
A life without you has no damn meaning.

440
00:33:33,100 --> 00:33:34,490
I just realized that...

441
00:33:36,340 --> 00:33:38,310
I couldn't live without you.

442
00:33:42,000 --> 00:33:43,500
So from now on,

443
00:33:43,520 --> 00:33:45,100
I'll do whatever it takes.

444
00:33:46,660 --> 00:33:49,530
No matter what it costs me,
or no matter how hard it gets,

445
00:33:51,090 --> 00:33:53,010
I'll do everything
for us to get back together.

446
00:33:55,150 --> 00:33:56,410
No matter how hard you try,

447
00:33:56,420 --> 00:33:57,790
- I won't...
- No matter how firm you are,

448
00:33:57,800 --> 00:33:59,320
I'll win you back,

449
00:34:00,570 --> 00:34:02,610
and I'll make it
so that you wanna take me back.

450
00:34:04,420 --> 00:34:10,199
♫I'm only asking that I never lose your touch♫

451
00:34:10,230 --> 00:34:12,810
♫I'm sorry I messed up♫

452
00:34:13,150 --> 00:34:14,699
I'm not giving up, Wan.

453
00:34:16,110 --> 00:34:19,960
♫That's all I want♫

454
00:34:38,239 --> 00:34:39,760
The fashion week in Milan,

455
00:34:40,500 --> 00:34:41,960
the brand's already confirmed it, Nine.

456
00:34:42,760 --> 00:34:43,530
Alright.

457
00:34:44,040 --> 00:34:46,060
And that big project I mentioned,

458
00:34:46,650 --> 00:34:48,830
the series called 'IDYLLIC LIES,'

459
00:34:50,139 --> 00:34:53,690
it's been confirmed that you'll take
a lead role in its third season!

460
00:34:54,969 --> 00:34:56,100
Are you serious, Pitch?!

461
00:34:56,239 --> 00:34:57,150
Of course.

462
00:34:57,930 --> 00:34:59,690
And I have to fly
to the United States, right?

463
00:34:59,700 --> 00:35:00,460
Yes!

464
00:35:00,730 --> 00:35:01,730
Of course!

465
00:35:01,750 --> 00:35:04,540
You're going international!

466
00:35:04,560 --> 00:35:05,800
Holy shit!

467
00:35:17,160 --> 00:35:17,960
Pitch,

468
00:35:21,850 --> 00:35:23,340
Nine has to move out.

469
00:35:24,140 --> 00:35:25,020
Why?

470
00:35:25,320 --> 00:35:26,070
What happened?

471
00:35:57,430 --> 00:35:58,540
Is everything alright?

472
00:35:59,050 --> 00:36:00,400
I saw it under the door.

473
00:36:01,150 --> 00:36:02,430
Is this yours, Nine?

474
00:36:14,540 --> 00:36:15,540
Nine,

475
00:36:16,150 --> 00:36:17,470
how did they know about Juno?

476
00:36:21,950 --> 00:36:23,190
[Everywhere you go, I'll always
be there for the good and the bad,

477
00:36:23,200 --> 00:36:24,270
whether it's about Wan, Third, Juno,

478
00:36:24,280 --> 00:36:25,560
or Thee who already died, XOXO]

479
00:36:49,490 --> 00:36:50,710
Wow...

480
00:36:50,980 --> 00:36:52,410
There are flowers.

481
00:36:54,690 --> 00:36:55,760
Real ones, by the way.

482
00:36:59,500 --> 00:37:00,520
You like them?

483
00:37:05,380 --> 00:37:06,290
Oh?

484
00:37:08,100 --> 00:37:09,230
- Hello.
- Hello.

485
00:37:09,250 --> 00:37:10,380
- Hi there.
- Hello, hello.

486
00:37:18,150 --> 00:37:19,140
Uh...

487
00:37:19,880 --> 00:37:22,000
"Congratulations to Mr. Ren,

488
00:37:22,460 --> 00:37:25,600
the new executive of 'NPY'"

489
00:37:27,300 --> 00:37:28,000
Huh?

490
00:37:28,320 --> 00:37:30,260
Thank you, boyfriend of the executive.

491
00:37:32,170 --> 00:37:33,370
- Huh?
- Huh?

492
00:37:36,930 --> 00:37:37,480
Baffled.

493
00:37:37,860 --> 00:37:39,060
I'm baffled.

494
00:37:39,070 --> 00:37:41,540
Uh, so that means

495
00:37:41,550 --> 00:37:43,870
when the investor pulled out,

496
00:37:44,610 --> 00:37:45,760
you took pretty major damage, right?

497
00:37:46,350 --> 00:37:47,600
Well, pretty much.

498
00:37:47,810 --> 00:37:49,530
North already took care of it.

499
00:37:51,970 --> 00:37:52,780
"I"

500
00:37:52,800 --> 00:37:53,580
already...

501
00:37:53,590 --> 00:37:54,880
took care of it.

502
00:37:59,970 --> 00:38:02,550
Then I'll give you
some time to talk to Renji.

503
00:38:03,860 --> 00:38:04,570
- Oh, right.
- Okay.

504
00:38:05,290 --> 00:38:05,870
Alright.

505
00:38:15,600 --> 00:38:16,930
Oh, please take a seat.

506
00:38:16,940 --> 00:38:18,540
- Okay, we’re taking a seat. Sure.
- Okay.

507
00:38:18,560 --> 00:38:19,560
Hang on a sec.

508
00:38:20,800 --> 00:38:21,990
Uh...

509
00:38:24,720 --> 00:38:26,870
Alright, let me ask this straight up.

510
00:38:27,170 --> 00:38:28,120
So, right now,

511
00:38:28,570 --> 00:38:29,850
you've completely replaced North, right?

512
00:38:31,250 --> 00:38:33,490
So now, Ren is the big boss?

513
00:38:33,670 --> 00:38:34,970
The big boss.

514
00:38:35,280 --> 00:38:36,190
I like that.

515
00:38:39,300 --> 00:38:40,980
So, the reason I asked you to come

516
00:38:41,000 --> 00:38:44,060
is that I'm planning on a new series,

517
00:38:44,460 --> 00:38:46,300
so I need you as the director

518
00:38:46,310 --> 00:38:47,240
and you as the acting coach.

519
00:38:49,350 --> 00:38:50,940
A new series?

520
00:38:51,660 --> 00:38:52,520
What about 'The Deep Between Us'?

521
00:38:52,650 --> 00:38:53,550
Screw it.

522
00:38:54,300 --> 00:38:55,690
We have to move forward.

523
00:38:57,050 --> 00:38:58,600
Without any strings pulled this time.

524
00:38:59,310 --> 00:39:01,040
Let's go for full-fledged skills.

525
00:39:02,780 --> 00:39:03,750
You mean, without any strings pulled

526
00:39:03,760 --> 00:39:05,330
like that for "Renji." None of that?

527
00:39:08,670 --> 00:39:10,680
Exactly. I was just testing the system.

528
00:39:11,370 --> 00:39:13,160
But I know now the system can't change.

529
00:39:13,180 --> 00:39:14,160
If you want change,

530
00:39:14,170 --> 00:39:15,650
you need to own the system.

531
00:39:15,960 --> 00:39:17,160
So you're saying that

532
00:39:17,190 --> 00:39:18,570
as a director,

533
00:39:18,660 --> 00:39:21,660
I have all the decision-making authority?

534
00:39:21,970 --> 00:39:23,020
You're right.

535
00:39:26,280 --> 00:39:27,390
You mean it?

536
00:39:28,160 --> 00:39:29,530
I mean it.

537
00:39:30,850 --> 00:39:31,850
Okay.

538
00:39:32,040 --> 00:39:35,040
So, are you still gonna cast
the same male leads?

539
00:39:35,280 --> 00:39:36,260
Not sure...

540
00:39:36,270 --> 00:39:37,580
but definitely not Nine.

541
00:39:41,180 --> 00:39:41,960
Um...

542
00:39:42,680 --> 00:39:43,680
I'm not sure...

543
00:39:44,110 --> 00:39:46,060
if you have heard, but Nine

544
00:39:46,370 --> 00:39:48,590
has been cast in 'IDYLLIC LIES.'

545
00:39:48,870 --> 00:39:49,560
Huh?

546
00:39:50,060 --> 00:39:51,520
'IDYLLIC LIES'?

547
00:39:51,860 --> 00:39:52,860
Yes.

548
00:39:54,160 --> 00:39:55,450
So...

549
00:39:55,660 --> 00:39:58,100
how about we all try to get along?

550
00:39:58,120 --> 00:39:59,250
- Mm.
- Yeah?

551
00:39:59,260 --> 00:40:01,860
We might just
work together again in the future.

552
00:40:02,340 --> 00:40:03,780
And honestly,

553
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:06,250
it will benefit your company, Ren.

554
00:40:13,320 --> 00:40:14,340
Nine,

555
00:40:14,770 --> 00:40:16,520
I heard you talked to the content team

556
00:40:16,540 --> 00:40:18,670
about releasing the yearly plan yourself?

557
00:40:19,390 --> 00:40:20,300
Yes.

558
00:40:21,260 --> 00:40:23,500
I want us to tell the media first

559
00:40:23,860 --> 00:40:25,790
that there's a series
coming up as a mega project.

